{"id": "EUVD-2026-107011", "enisaUuid": "5b80693f-1906-3e26-9383-8e7cadfabe7e", "description": "SvelteKit (@sveltejs/kit) before 3.0.0 contains an open redirect vulnerability in enhanced form actions (use:enhance) on routes accepting paths beginning with a double slash. Attackers can craft action paths starting with // that become protocol-relative URLs, causing non-redirect form results to navigate victims to attacker-controlled sites.", "datePublished": "2026-10-21T00:36:34", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T15:50:38", "baseScore": 2.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:A/VC:N/VI:N/VA:N/SC:L/SI:L/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/sveltejs/kit/security/advisories/GHSA-pfhg-q3qv-9q6r", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/sveltekit-before-3.0.0-open-redirect-via-enhanced-form-actions"], "aliases": ["GHSA-pvhg-7v4p-f5q9", "CVE-2026-114060"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.17, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "d4ec90fb-a708-3543-a197-993579064838", "product": {"name": "kit", "vendor": {"name": "sveltejs"}}, "product_version": "0 <3.0.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "1c6198bf-5949-35a8-9679-a7ce7db06258", "vendor": {"name": "sveltejs"}}], "isExploited": false}